[1mindex 6556711..41f30d5 100644[m
[1m--- a/Package/README.md[m
[1m+++ b/Package/README.md[m
[36m@@ -2,17 +2,16 @@[m
 [m
 This plugin exists to integrate Hot Lava with the [Archipelago](https://archipelago.gg/) multiword randomizer software.[m
 [m
[31m-## Configuration[m
[32m+[m[32m## Connecting to Archipelago[m
 [m
[31m-To connect to Archipelago, you will need to provide the room URL, the player/slot name, and the room password. This can be done in 1 of 2 ways:[m
[32m+[m[32mTo connect to an Archipelago multiworld, follow these steps:[m
 [m
[31m-### Config File[m
[31m-[m
[31m-After downloading the mod, and launching the game in modded mode, a config file for the plugin should be generated in %AppData%\Thunderstore Mod Manager\DataFolder\HotLava\profiles\Default\BepInEx\config. Open this file up in any text editor and update the values as necessary.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-### Command[m
[31m-[m
[31m-When connecting to the room, provide the necessary values using the following command format: `/apconnect [<roomUrl>] [<playerName>] [<password>]` (Example: `/apconnect archipelago.gg:38281 Bongo9911 testPassword123`)[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Download this plugin[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Launch the game modded[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Start a new profile[m
[32m+[m[32m4. After the intro cutscene completes, open the pause menu by pressing Esc[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Open the Archipelago menu, enter in the necessary details, and press "Connect"[m
[32m+[m[32m6. If it connects successfully, you're all ready to go![m
 [m
 ## Other Links[m
 [m
